1	// DOM-wiring layer for the four "Stage adds" generator forms, the two
2	// visibility-toggle checkboxes, and the staged-commands textarea/copy/clear
3	// controls (Phase 5 sibling of matrix-interactions.ts, per
4	// residual/iterations/view-live-editing-plan.md). Attaches to an
5	// already-server-rendered fixture matching src/view/shell.html's markup
6	// contract (forms with `data-command-generator`, the toolbar's two new
7	// `data-show-proposed-toggle` / `data-show-unrelated-toggle` checkboxes, the
8	// live `<table class="matrix">`, `#staged-commands`, `#copy-staged`,
9	// `#clear-staged`).
10	//
11	// This module owns DOM mutation only — every state transition is delegated
12	// to addComponentColumn / addAttractorOption / addForceRow / updateForceField
13	// (./actions); command-line rendering is delegated to toCommandLines
14	// (./model); visibility decisions are delegated to visibleComponents
15	// (./render-decisions).
